# Pairs with HandOffMeetsCoreForeignAlloc (H -> C). HandOffBound is dropped, so a foreign
# append is allocated while L's marker reads closed.
MODULE: HandOffMeetsCoreForeignAllocUnbounded
TARGET: HandOffMeetsCoreForeignAlloc
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: HandOffBound is dropped

--- FIND
Guarantees ==
    /\ ClaimHeadCoversPriorAppends
    /\ RaisedEpochUnique
    /\ StaleEpochNeverAppends
    /\ HandOffBound
    /\ StraddlerBelowInit
    /\ BulkHintBound
--- REPLACE
Guarantees ==
    /\ ClaimHeadCoversPriorAppends
    /\ RaisedEpochUnique
    /\ StaleEpochNeverAppends
    /\ StraddlerBelowInit
    /\ BulkHintBound
--- END
